  The headline and reel_script say the hartal was from 6 AM to 5 PM, but the article says it was from 6 AM to 5:30 PM.
  The reel_script says the hartal affected government and quasi-government institutions, but the article does not mention quasi-government institutions.
  The reel_script says the hartal affected schools, colleges, and KSRTC services, but the article does not mention schools being closed, only that classes were not held because students did not come.
  The reel_script and slides_spec do not mention that private buses, autos, and taxis stopped their services, only that they were stopped by protesters.
  The reel_script does not mention that the hartal was called by the Malayor Development Committee to protest the eviction of Malayali people in the name of Western Ghats protection.
  The reel_script does not mention that the hartal affected multiple towns and panchayats, not just Nilambur municipality and panchayats.
  The reel_script does not mention that shops reopened in the evening.
  The reel_script does not mention that the hartal was supported by various organizations.
